php-vm calls proposal 0003: `__call` trampolines keep by-reference arguments (zend_call_function does
not separate references for ZEND_ACC_CALL_VIA_TRAMPOLINE). Applies after 0002. File: call.rs.

call_user_func_array([$proxy, 'missing'], [&$x]) must hand __call an $args array that still holds the
reference, so __call can pass it on by reference. call_pending skips the by-ref/deref argument loop
for a trampoline (the loop checked __call's own ($name, $args) parameters), and push_user_frame no
longer dereferences positional arguments when it packs $args. Arguments sent by DO_FCALL are values
already. Fixes Zend/tests/magic_methods/bug50394.

